  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><strong>科博蒙：擴充內容</strong></span></h1><p><strong><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">◽ 本專案旨在基於科博蒙模組新增多種物品、盔甲、礦石、工具與武器。</span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">若想搭配MOD「機械動力」的合成配方遊玩此版本模組，請造訪我的另一個模組連結：</span></strong> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cobblemon-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">科博蒙：機械工業</a></strong></span></p><h3><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><strong>現有功能：</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">◽ </span>盔甲<br>- 新增8套比鑽石更強的新盔甲，自帶附魔與永久藥水效果。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><strong>◽ 工具與武器<br>- 新增40種製作時自帶附魔的新工具與武器。</strong></span></p><hr><h1>盔甲系列</h1><table style=\"width:100%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\"><strong>盔甲類型</strong></th>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\"><strong>特殊效果</strong></th>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\"><strong>靴子附魔</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">火之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">火焰抗性</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">火焰保護 II</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">水之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">水下呼吸</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">水下速掘 II</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">葉之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">無</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">摔落保護 III + 荆棘 III</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">雷之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">急迫 II + 50% 移動速度</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">無</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">日之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">無</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">保護 IV + 投射物保護 IV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">月之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">無</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">保護 IV + 爆炸保護 IV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">覺醒之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">跳躍提升 IV + 摔落傷害免疫</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">無</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">暗之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">飽食</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">無</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><ul>\n<li>- 所有盔甲皆使用對應的進化石製作。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6a264b91-140c-42d4-bebf-f461fedf6632.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"345\" height=\"215\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f5348add-f280-4475-80be-e313b4c314fb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"215\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a1ac8df3-d51c-470a-9603-b0f23174a1f8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"437\" height=\"155\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_042b6cd6-ada2-48a3-8b4c-b7ac0781f984.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"824\" height=\"170\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_2c42bba3-6a8c-4df0-a10b-4a8102c8ab98.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"202\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_66510804-6e5b-43fe-9b02-0214d9863f95.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"201\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_d088154b-d0ae-45c1-bba0-5c352a910210.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"202\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_02701298-5f6e-4511-a3f4-1a776027c12b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"200\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_5862ee7b-c5d6-4dd7-bdaa-0e267f4d4231.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"116\" height=\"201\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_31ed17b0-0cb5-4b01-b258-76a59aaadc9e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"122\" height=\"202\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_60f3bb04-6f98-4b40-8276-795cc2ec4509.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"223\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_d7caa27c-a9ea-4004-8d7a-e26c2fd16d7e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"208\"></p>",
